  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: 
    lineText: "THE ROAD HOME\L\LThe Demon Lord was slain.\LTheir greatest battle
      was behind them.\LThey had only to return home.\LBut the road was long.\LOne
      companion fell.\LThe others carried on."
